    "Source-index proof requires zero R2 reads, no HEADs, and exactly two S3 GETs for full blocks or one for access=0.",
    "Source auth-cache proof additionally requires auth HIT and zero KV reads. A legitimate five-second TTL miss stays visible and successful, with its real KV read.",
